# What the container image installs, pinned with hashes: the runtime
# dependencies, and setuptools and wheel to build the package itself, which
# the Dockerfile installs with --no-deps --no-build-isolation after this lock.
# The image runs Python 3.12 on Linux:
#   uv pip compile image.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -o image.txt
# Dependabot proposes each new release.
